Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.00,0:00:11.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,《小鬼当家4：玩转新居》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.64,0:00:21.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,薇薇，我知道只剩三天购物日了 但客户打电话来说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Viv, I know there are only three shopping days left, but they called,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.52,0:00:23.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们想在一小时后 去你看的房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they want to see your house in an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.52,0:00:25.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.73,0:00:27.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈！叫巴兹关掉音乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom! Make Buzz turn off the music.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.73,0:00:29.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没问题 - 妈！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No problem. - Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.82,0:00:31.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妈 - 等一下，薇薇\N{\fnArial\fs30}- "Mom." - Hang on, Viv.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.03,0:00:33.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让你姐姐好好排练 - 希望这会有所帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let your sister rehearse. - Like that'll help.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.90,0:00:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 去把厨房打扫一下 - 但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And clean up the kitchen. - But…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.99,0:00:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，薇薇，稍后见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now. Okay, Viv. I'll see you in a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.74,0:00:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过要你去打扫一下厨房\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I told you to clean up the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.83,0:00:42.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我已经搞定了，今晚我可以和朋友去看电影吗？ - 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did. Can I go to the movies tonight with some friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.95,0:00:44.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 不…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - No…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.33,0:00:47.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，不行，我要带客户去看房子，你得照顾凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. I'm showing a house, and I need you to baby-sit Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.29,0:00:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何不叫梅根呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, why can't Megan do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.38,0:00:50.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,她要排练啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because she has to go to rehearsal at the teen center.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.30,0:00:51.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不一定要去看电影啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you don't have to go to the movies.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.71,0:00:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不去，生活就乐趣了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do if I want a life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.30,0:00:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得照顾凯文 他人在哪里？凯文！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're baby-sitting Kevin. Hey, where is he, anyway? Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.34,0:00:59.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是什么？这是什么？ - 是车子！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is it? What is it? - It's a car!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.80,0:01:01.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喔！ - 等等，那是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Whoa! - Wait a second. That was…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.97,0:01:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的，那是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, that was mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.27,0:01:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了 又有天线，什么都有\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was awesome. It's got an antenna and everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.27,0:01:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 圣诞快乐，妈妈 - 圣诞快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Merry Christmas, Mommy. - Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.52,0:01:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 圣诞快乐 - 在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Merry Christmas. - Over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.07,0:01:14.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 送我什么礼物？ - 这是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What did I get? - What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.24,0:01:16.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 大家一起来录像\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you. - Okay, everybody get in the shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.91,0:01:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 大家一起来 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Everybody get together. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.49,0:01:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好，圣诞快乐 - 圣诞快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Merry Christmas. Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.16,0:01:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 圣诞快乐 - 非常欢乐，巴兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merry Christmas. Very funny, Buzz.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.04,0:01:29.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 去年的圣诞节影片吗？ - 对啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Last Christmas, huh? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.00,0:01:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,今年的圣诞节将不再有欢乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}This Christmas isn't gonna be any fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.13,0:01:37.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然会有欢乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, of course it will.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.51,0:01:41.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的，我们会像从前 做一样的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, we're gonna do all the same things we've always done.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.18,0:01:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,与家人和朋友…一起唱圣诞歌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sing Christmas carols, be with family and friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.81,0:01:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,把饼干和牛奶放在外面 等待圣诞老人的来临\N{\fnArial\fs30}put cookies and milk out for Santa.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.19,0:01:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一切如同往常 - 除了今年…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's gonna be just the same. - Except this year…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.90,0:01:55.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有了爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}no Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.11,0:01:58.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错，就只有这点不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. That's the one thing that's different.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.49,0:02:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两人为什么不复合呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why can't you just get back together?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.78,0:02:04.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的，我们这样做 也是迫不得已啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, we're just gonna have to let that go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.62,0:02:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说不可能，对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a no, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.21,0:02:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕竟无法事事如意\N{\fnArial\fs30}It means some things are just out of our control.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.92,0:02:14.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你想念你爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you miss your dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.21,0:02:16.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他非常爱我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he loves me very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.84,0:02:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两人都很爱我 但是却没有办法复合\N{\fnArial\fs30}You both do, and it has nothing to do with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.09,0:02:24.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他告诉了你吗？ - 我已经九岁了，我看了很多电视\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did he tell you that? - I'm nine years old. I watch a lot of TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.93,0:02:28.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他因为我而离开的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he leave because of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.23,0:02:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是，当然不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.44,0:02:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道，一定是因为巴兹和梅根\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew it! It was Buzz and Megan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.73,0:02:39.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔，不是因为任何人或任何事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it wasn't anyone… or any one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.70,0:02:40.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然是因为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.62,0:02:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一切都一言难尽啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not easy to explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.54,0:02:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,但，嗯，有时候当…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, uh, sometimes when…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.96,0:02:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们结婚很久以后 他们会感到枯燥乏味\N{\fnArial\fs30}people are married for a long time, they get into kind of a rut.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.38,0:02:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你知道什么是枯燥乏味？ - 知道，比如说，当人们不再感到欢乐…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know what a rut is? - Yeah. When people aren't having any fun,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.51,0:02:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且真的觉得厌烦时\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they're really bored.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.51,0:03:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.05,0:03:03.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要下楼吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, will you come downstairs?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.60,0:03:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.06,0:03:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.65,0:03:17.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.07,0:03:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 凯文，进来 - 快点，你必须看看这个！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Kevin, come in here. - Yeah, hurry, you've gotta see this!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.29,0:03:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔！嘿！嘿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ow! Hey! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.16,0:03:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你总是喜欢那样 - 让我起来，豆花脸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You always fall for that. - Let me up, zit-face!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.87,0:03:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 笨蛋，你什么时候才学的会啊 - 放开你弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lamebrain. When are you gonna learn? - Get off your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.67,0:03:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不用排练了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And shouldn't you be rehearsing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.05,0:03:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要怎么去青少年中心？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you getting to the teen center?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.46,0:03:41.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,娅希莉的妈妈会来接我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ashley's mom's picking me up in a half hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.88,0:03:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,能让我去看电影吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I please go to the movies?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.05,0:03:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行，我说过你要照顾凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I told you. You're watching Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.93,0:03:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让他去吧，我可以一个人待在家 - 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Please let him go. I'll stay home alone. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.64,0:03:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我曾经做过啊 - 别令我想起往事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I've done it before. - Don't remind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.10,0:03:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你浪费了我整个夜晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}You loused up my whole night.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.44,0:03:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我不好过 你也别想好到哪里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if I'm gonna be miserable, you're gonna be miserable.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.53,0:04:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.11,0:04:03.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哈啰，是我 - 爸爸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello. It's me. - Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.32,0:04:04.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸爸！ - 嘿，乖儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dad! - Hey, big guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.03,0:04:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你今晚会来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know you were coming tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.66,0:04:09.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喔，我想给你一个惊喜 - 嘿，爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, I thought I'd surprise you. - Hey, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.62,0:04:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，巴兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Buzz.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.16,0:04:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔，凯特，我的天 很不错的房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Kate. Gosh, the place looks great.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.83,0:04:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的装饰得很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really nice decorations.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.92,0:04:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 跟往年一样 - 因此，嗯…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Same as every year. - So, um,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.92,0:04:22.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸，你今晚怎么会来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, why'd you come tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.72,0:04:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实，我想和你妈妈谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, I want to talk to your mom about something.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.01,0:04:28.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,私下谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Privately.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.10,0:04:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你想过爸爸会回家吗？ - 啊，凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you think he wants to come home? - Aw, Kev.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.11,0:04:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 聊什么？ - 没有，就是单纯问候\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - No "Hello, how are ya?"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.07,0:04:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起，我有个生意要忙 彼得，你到底想干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I have a business appointment, Peter. What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.65,0:04:44.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，我本来不想要再次面对婚姻 但…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, gosh. I wasn't gonna jump right into it, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.45,0:04:49.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道娜塔莉的 我们已经住在一起，嗯…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you know Natalie and I are living together, and, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.66,0:04:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此当我们离婚后 我就要和她结婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, when our divorce is final, I'm gonna marry her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.62,0:04:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.84,0:05:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要再婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're getting married again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.05,0:05:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔，那，嗯…那…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. That's, uh… that…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.89,0:05:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只分居了八个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. We've only been separated eight months.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.89,0:05:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…事情发生得如此突然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I… it just happened real quickly, and…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.69,0:05:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着，凯特…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, Kate,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.61,0:05:22.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的想要和孩子们 一起度过这一段假期\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really want the kids to spend a little time with me over the holidays.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.19,0:05:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要和孩子们一起过圣诞节？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want the kids for Christmas?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.65,0:05:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要两天，我想要他们更加认识娜塔莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a couple of days. I want them to get to know Natalie better.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.74,0:05:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔，因为她就要成为他们的继母了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, because she's gonna be their, uh, stepmother.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.50,0:05:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.00,0:05:41.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得去问他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you're gonna have to ask them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.67,0:05:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.59,0:05:47.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该怎么找朋友？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How am I supposed to see my friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.38,0:05:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只有几天时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's only for a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.84,0:05:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,但对我来说 这么长的时间会让友情变淡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, duh, but that's just long enough for me to fall out of the loop.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.56,0:05:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确，但你不能要求我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you can't expect us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.06,0:05:56.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 放弃假期 - 怎么样，凯文？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- to give up our vacation. - Well, Kevin?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.89,0:05:58.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,将会有一个皇室家庭来拜访\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a royal family coming to visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.60,0:06:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们有一位你同年龄的男孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have a son around your age.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.02,0:06:03.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有机会和王子一起玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, you might have a chance to play with a crown prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.36,0:06:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 王子？ - 是不是很酷啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A crown prince? - Wouldn't that be cool?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.15,0:06:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 的确很酷 - 你肯定不会相信那个房间…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, way cool. - Yeah, and you guys wouldn't believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.49,0:06:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜塔莉为你布置的那个房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}the room that Natalie has set up for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.91,0:06:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的答案呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.87,0:06:22.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我还是不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I'm gonna pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.38,0:06:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为在圣诞节离开家，这是不对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It just wouldn't be right leaving the family at Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.76,0:06:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我确信你会理解 - 是的，我能理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sure you understand. - Yeah. Yeah, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.34,0:06:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这…这算是一个公开的邀约吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's… it's… it's an open invitation, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.14,0:06:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会太晚回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I won't be back too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.73,0:06:41.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然你都要待在家 多少做一些家务事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And since you're staying home, it wouldn't hurt to do some of your chores.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.56,0:06:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,是，夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.77,0:06:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会做好家务事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll make sure they get done.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.04,0:06:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,来打扫吧，干酪脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clean it, cheese-face.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.51,0:07:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.68,0:07:19.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oops.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.27,0:07:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不小心的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}My fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.86,0:07:33.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈啰，我回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, I'm home…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.87,0:07:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.79,0:07:38.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么样？ - 很糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How'd it go? - Awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.66,0:07:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我讨厌巴兹，我永远都不想 和他单独待在家里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate Buzz, and I never want to be stuck home alone with him as long as I live.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.25,0:07:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔，宝贝 我知道他找你麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, honey. I know he picks on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.54,0:07:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,找麻烦？ 他是羞辱我，折磨我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Picks on me? Humiliates me, tortures me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.59,0:07:51.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想变成这里所有人的出气筒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sick of being everyone's favorite joke around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.01,0:07:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,是，是 当最小的孩子是很难受的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah, it's hard to be the youngest.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.18,0:07:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我讨厌巴兹 但愿我没有哥哥和姐姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I hate Buzz. I wish I didn't have a brother or a sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.10,0:08:00.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不是这个意思 - 是，就是这个意思！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, you don't mean that. - Yes, I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.73,0:08:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望就只有我一个小孩！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I was an only child!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.11,0:08:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我很抱歉让你这么不高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well… I'm sorry that you're so unhappy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.28,0:08:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你应该到你房间想想 珍惜你所拥有的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you should go to your room and think about what you have,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.61,0:08:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是你没有的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}rather than what you don't have.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.29,0:08:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有孩子们不知道 他们拥有是多么的美好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only children don't know how good they have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.00,0:08:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是巴兹和梅根不在 生活会多么美好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Life would be perfect if Buzz and Megan weren't around.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.43,0:08:37.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要一个真正喜欢我的家庭 这样会太过分吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, is it too much to ask for a family who actually likes me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.43,0:08:41.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得逃跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd run away…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.35,0:08:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我知道能逃到哪里的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}if I knew where to run to.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.40,0:08:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，对了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.19,0:08:51.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有一个公开的邀请\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have an open invitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.91,0:09:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我解不开我的安全带\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't get my seat belt unfastened.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.63,0:09:12.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢，亚伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Alan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.88,0:09:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.10,0:09:21.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔，多么不可思议的夜晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, what an incredible evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.39,0:09:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及一个不错的夜间工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}And not a bad night's work.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.35,0:09:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们为了那些孩子 慈善募款了两百万\N{\fnArial\fs30}We raised over two million for those children's charities.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.27,0:09:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Door, open.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.07,0:09:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就要和芝加哥两位最大的客户签约了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I am on the verge of signing two of the biggest clients in Chicago.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.28,0:09:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你是世界上最厉害的公关\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's because you're the best publicist in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.70,0:09:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,关门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doors, close.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.70,0:09:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要感谢你的大力宣传吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have I remembered to thank you for telling everyone that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.00,0:09:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开炉火 今晚，你要不要来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire, light. Not tonight you haven't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.00,0:09:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该对你表示感激\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps I ought to show my appreciation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.46,0:09:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,放音乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Music, on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.21,0:09:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,关上窗帘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Curtains, close.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.18,0:10:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊，事情正在逐渐好转中…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw, nuts. Just when things were getting good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.85,0:10:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,漂亮的房子，嗯，宝贝？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice house, huh, pumpkin?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.73,0:10:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错，马文！你想不想进去抢劫啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure is, Marv. You sure you don't wanna rob it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.40,0:10:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，不，我并不想要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, I don't wanna rob it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.65,0:10:14.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的抢劫生涯已经结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My robbery days are over.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.36,0:10:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的！我们将会得到很多钱，好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, darling, we're moving up to the big money. All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.49,0:10:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且是来得容易的钱，不需要中间人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The easy money. No middleman.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.49,0:10:22.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,赚的都纯利润，只要谨慎小心的执行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pure profit. Strictly a class operation, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.83,0:10:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,就几个词：「薇拉」、「绑架」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three words, Vera. Kid-na-pping.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.37,0:10:28.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为那是一个词\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think that's only one word.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.42,0:10:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只需要待到皇室的到来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna wait for the royals to arrive…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.09,0:10:35.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们就绑架那个王子\N{\fnArial\fs30}hup, dup, dodey-do and then we're gonna kidnap the prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.63,0:10:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,「喔，别绑架我」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Oh, don't kidnap me. I'm fancy."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.63,0:10:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我们会成功吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure we can pull it off?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.64,0:10:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不需要哈利帮忙计划吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, without Harry making the plans?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.64,0:10:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利的计划会帮我们什么？ 只会帮我们进监牢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look where Harry's plans kept landing me, huh? In jail.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.02,0:10:47.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 - 好了，这次不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mmm. - Well, not this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.02,0:10:49.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这次…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because this time…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.94,0:10:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是老大\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.94,0:10:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁是老大？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Who's the boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.94,0:10:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是老大 - 我喜欢结婚，嗯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're the boss. - I love being married. Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.29,0:11:06.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的乖女孩 - 嘿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's my girl. - Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.79,0:11:09.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 太好了 - 喔！他们好像有访客到来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right. - Oh! Looks like they got a visitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.94,0:11:34.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这个地方吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This where you want to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.23,0:11:36.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，就是这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, this is the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.82,0:11:38.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常感谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.99,0:11:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,零钱留给你吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep the change.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.78,0:11:43.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这全部都是零钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all change.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.98,0:12:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.49,0:12:27.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起，夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beg your pardon, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.99,0:12:29.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，普雷斯特？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Prescott?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.04,0:12:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一个小孩子说要拜访麦卡斯特先生 他说是他的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. McCallister has a visitor. The young man claims to be his son.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.00,0:12:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，带他进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, send him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.67,0:12:41.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 凯文！ - 爸爸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Kevin! - Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.72,0:12:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！喔！我以为你不来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Oh! I thought you said weren't coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.22,0:12:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I started thinking,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.80,0:12:49.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果小孩都只和妈妈 一起过圣诞节，那是很不公平的\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Hey, it's not fair if Mom gets all the kids for Christmas."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.35,0:12:51.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣诞节怎么能不和小孩一起过呢，对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's Christmas without kids, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.77,0:12:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，哈啰，凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Hello, Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.98,0:12:56.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨，娜塔莉 希望你不介意我临时的来访…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Natalie. I hope you don't mind me just dropping in like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.15,0:12:58.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我爸爸真的邀请了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}but my dad did invite me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.73,0:13:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是，我知道 - 那邀请是公开的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, I know. - So is the invitation still open?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.36,0:13:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然是 茉莉，请你过来一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course it is. Molly, would you come here, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.37,0:13:10.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直期待着和你一起过圣诞节\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been looking forward to spending time with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.08,0:13:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爸爸和我聊过很多关于你的事迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your dad talks about you kids a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.08,0:13:15.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴兹是个捣乱鬼，但我是人见人爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buzz is the troublemaker. I'm the adorable one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.62,0:13:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔，茉莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Ah, Molly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.54,0:13:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位是凯文·麦卡斯特 他要和我们一起待上几天\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Kevin McCallister, and he's going to be staying with us for a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.30,0:13:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以为他 准备一个客房吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you make up the special guest room?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.05,0:13:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊，客房\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, the special guest room.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.55,0:13:28.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上准备，夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right away, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.26,0:13:35.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还有！普雷斯特，给凯文一把房子的遥控器 - 好的，夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, and Prescott, give Kevin a house key. - If you say so, ma' am.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.32,0:13:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么遥控器？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of key is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.78,0:13:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是整栋房子的遥控器\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a key to the whole house.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.94,0:13:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一栋智能型住宅，凯文 它会执行你所吩咐的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a smart house, Kevin. It does whatever you tell it to.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.03,0:13:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,熄灭炉火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire, out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.45,0:13:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开窗帘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Curtains, open.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.83,0:14:00.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔！我想我会喜欢这里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow! I think I'm gonna like it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.84,0:14:05.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧，试试看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead. You try.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.88,0:14:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Door, open.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.23,0:14:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔！这里真的很酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow! This stuff is so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.73,0:14:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔，我的天！喔，我的天！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my gosh! Oh, my gosh!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.74,0:14:29.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么酷的东西！\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is such cool stuff! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.28,0:14:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔！看看这游戏！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Look at this game!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.53,0:14:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是电玩专用椅！喔！\N{\fnArial\fs30}This chair's a remote control chair! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.75,0:14:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔，太棒了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.96,0:14:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太酷了！喔！\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is so cool! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.54,0:14:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你觉得这里舒服吗？ - 太舒服了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Think you'll be comfortable here? - I'll say!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.00,0:14:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢，娜塔莉 这是有史以来最好的圣诞节！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Natalie. This is gonna be the best Christmas ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.80,0:14:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,该熄灯了，凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lights out, Kev.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.18,0:14:51.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，凯文？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Kevin?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.85,0:14:53.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.56,0:14:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个孩子又躲去哪里了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many times can I lose this child?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.73,0:15:00.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.27,0:15:02.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喂 - 凯特，我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello. - Kate, I…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.56,0:15:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,…想告诉你，凯文在我这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to let you know Kevin just got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.07,0:15:07.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔，谢天谢地…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thank God.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.86,0:15:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他安全的在你那边…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He got there… safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.03,0:15:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我正想要打电话给你，但是… - 你没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I was gonna call you, but, uh… - You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.91,0:15:20.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事，我人很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yes, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.33,0:15:23.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你让他过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well… thanks for letting him come.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.88,0:15:27.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你的电话 - 圣诞快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, thanks for calling. - Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.76,0:15:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣诞快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.57,0:15:51.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,早安，凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good mornin', Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.49,0:15:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,早安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.57,0:15:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是谁？ - 过来，亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who's there? - Over here, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.12,0:15:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.75,0:16:00.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.75,0:16:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吃早餐了，任何餐点都随便你叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breakfast time. Anything special you'd like?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.58,0:16:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何餐点都可以？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.25,0:16:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何餐点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.53,0:16:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喔！ - 有时候我等不及圣诞老人的到来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wow! - Sometimes I can't wait for Santa to come,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.99,0:16:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我要去帮自己买礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I end up doing some shopping by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.87,0:16:41.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你想要开个礼物吗？ - 不，你宠坏他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Would you like to open one? - No, you're gonna spoil him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.37,0:16:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸爸，这是她的房子 - 如果她想宠坏我的话，她当然可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, it's her house. If she wants to spoil me, she can spoil me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.54,0:16:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，但只能一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. All right, but just one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.50,0:16:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不要开最大的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And not… the biggest one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.01,0:16:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真的会飞吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does it really fly?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.22,0:16:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的会，但只能在外面飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}It really does, but only outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.43,0:17:00.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们不喜欢搞坏任何东西 - 喔，谢谢你，娜塔莉！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We don't want to break anything. - Wow! Thanks, Natalie!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.98,0:17:06.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们为什么要离开？ 圣诞节就快要到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you have to leave? It's so close to Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.15,0:17:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道，但是帮娜塔莉募款的皇室就要来了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know, but the royal family's coming for one of Natalie's fund-raisers,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.15,0:17:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的工作就是确保这件事 能完美精彩的上新闻报导\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it's my job to make sure the event's well-covered by press and photographers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.95,0:17:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，这不会很久的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, it's not gonna take that long,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.16,0:17:21.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会占用你其余的假期时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I won't have to work for the rest of your vacation, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.45,0:17:24.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你有任何需求的话 就叫普雷斯特，他会帮忙你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you need anything, ask Prescott. He'll take care of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.42,0:17:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,很酷的飞机吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a cool plane, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.08,0:17:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜她是想要讨好我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think she's trying to buy my affection.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.13,0:17:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 凯文 - 怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Kevin. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.59,0:17:33.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没说这样子不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not saying it's a bad thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.47,0:17:36.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很开心有你在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.08,0:18:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,普雷斯特先生 可以帮我一个忙吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Prescott, can I ask you a question?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.21,0:18:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.92,0:18:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以帮我做一杯奶昔吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you make a milk shake?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.01,0:18:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,有巧克力吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have chocolate?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.05,0:18:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜塔莉说我想要什么就有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Natalie said anything I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.64,0:18:24.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你现在就需要一杯奶昔，是吗？ - 要巧克力口味的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And you need a milk shake, do you? - A chocolate one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.02,0:18:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得今年圣诞节会下雪吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think we'll have a white Christmas?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.60,0:18:30.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这似乎不太可能，因为最近的气温相当异常\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seems highly unlikely, given the recent unseasonable temperatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.31,0:18:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么？一个小电梯吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's this thing? A mini elevator?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.44,0:18:35.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是食物升降机\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's called a dumbwaiter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.70,0:18:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是用来做什么的？ - 这是专门送食物的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why is it called a waiter? - Because it carries food.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.91,0:18:42.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这会很吵吗？ - 这很安静…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why is it called dumb? - Because it doesn't speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.12,0:18:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且也不会一直问些烦人的愚蠢问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}or ask countless idiotic questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.20,0:19:21.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你识字吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you read?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.53,0:19:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,门上面写了「不准进入」\N{\fnArial\fs30}The door."No entry."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.08,0:19:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喔，这跟我有关系吗？ - 这是专门为你准备的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What, does that mean me? - Especially you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.30,0:19:39.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是房子的控制中心…\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the control center from which I manage this entire household,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.42,0:19:41.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括我的私人住所\N{\fnArial\fs30}as well as my personal quarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.30,0:19:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜塔莉小姐可能会 允许你进入其他的房间…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Miss Natalie may have granted you run of her home,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.85,0:19:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是这里是我的私人禁区，明白吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}but this is my domain and strictly off-limits. Understood?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.31,0:19:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有什么问题？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any more questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.02,0:19:53.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.08,0:20:08.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，茉莉，你在干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Molly. Whatcha doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.25,0:20:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,打扫房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cleanin' the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.41,0:20:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所有房间？ - 喔，不是，就只有这个房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Gross. - Oh, no, no. Not in this house.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.00,0:20:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,来看，吸尘器打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch. Vacuum, on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.63,0:20:26.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 吸尘器关闭 - 哇！这个壁炉可以自行清理\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Vacuum, off. - Wow! The place even cleans itself!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.01,0:20:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还想看更酷的事情吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Want to see somethin' really cool?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.77,0:20:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,芝麻开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open sesame.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.15,0:20:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！这里实在是太神奇了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow! This place is awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.15,0:20:42.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊，没错！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.72,0:21:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,要关掉音乐吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Music, off?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.31,0:21:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,关闭音乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Music, off.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.14,0:21:57.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去一下商店 一小时后就会回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm off to the store. I'll be back in an hour or so,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.73,0:21:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,对小孩子好一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}and don't pick on that dear child.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.11,0:22:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Door, open.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.99,0:22:12.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,她离开房子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's out of the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.62,0:22:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好，障碍物已经没有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Coast is clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.13,0:22:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在进去吧 - 等一下，你确定现在安全吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's go. - Wait. Are you sure it's safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.30,0:22:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝，假如不安全的话 我会带你进去吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pumpkin, would I take you in there if it wasn't safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.88,0:22:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果明天王子还是没来的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just if the prince don't arrive till tomorrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.38,0:22:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还要继续待在这里吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}why are we going in there now?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.80,0:22:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,在采取行动之前 薇拉，你觉得…\N{\fnArial\fs30}To get the lay of the land. What do ya think, Vera?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.60,0:22:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们明天进去就只是绑架小孩子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're just gonna go in there tomorrow and start grabbing kids?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.85,0:22:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,「喔，大家都进这辆车」 不只是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Ooh, everybody get in the van." No.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.56,0:22:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要想想绑架的适当地点、时间以及手段\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta figure out the where, the when, the how to get him out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.07,0:22:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道成功犯罪的秘密吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know the secret to criminal success?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.36,0:22:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是不要被抓住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not getting caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.78,0:22:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,计划、准备，以及做好备案\N{\fnArial\fs30}Planning. Preparation. Preparedness.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.28,0:22:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,「做好完全准备」 准备好做一个「有准备的人」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be prepared. Be a prepared "preperator."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.49,0:22:56.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃？这是我的座右铭 这也就是为什么我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eh? That's my motto, and that's why I'm…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.29,0:22:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是童子军的原因 - 不，是老大的原因！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A boy scout. - No. The boss, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.54,0:23:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁是老大？ - 你是老大！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who's the boss? - You're the boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.75,0:23:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 老大在哪里？ - 就在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the boss? Right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.05,0:23:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿，老大，还有一位呢？ - 就是我啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey. Boss, party of one. - Right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.42,0:23:08.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，我们走，亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Let's go, pookie.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.90,0:23:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不…不可能！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.07,0:23:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他！是马文！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is! It's Marv!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.16,0:23:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,普雷斯特先生 普雷斯特先生，你在吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Prescott? Mr. Prescott, are you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.96,0:23:46.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,普雷斯特先生！救命啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Prescott! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.43,0:23:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,马文，警报器是打开的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marv, the alarm is on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.27,0:24:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔，不，我们现在该怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. What are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.19,0:24:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,看我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch this, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.86,0:24:07.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.78,0:24:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,关闭警报器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alarm, off.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.74,0:24:17.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 - 开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hmm. - Door, open.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.50,0:24:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 啊 - 真是雕虫小技\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ahh! - That is one handy gadget.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.46,0:24:23.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔，你忘了 我的座右铭是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what's my motto?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.88,0:24:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是老大？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.75,0:24:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 「做好完全准备」 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- "Be prepared." Yeah. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.13,0:24:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我娶了一个「天才」！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I married a genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.64,0:24:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么东西？是玩具吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think that is? Is that a turkey ball?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.48,0:24:42.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下来，好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, just put that down, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.85,0:24:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，你真像个惯窃\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Like a klepto here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.52,0:24:46.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,王子一定是待在某个房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, the prince should be staying in one of these rooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.73,0:24:48.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想那是一部电梯 - 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I think that's an elevator. - Don't…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.86,0:24:50.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不要让我头痛 - 你才让我头痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You give me such a headache. - You give me a headache.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.90,0:24:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是你让我头痛 - 是你让我头痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're giving me a headache. - You give me a headache.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.53,0:24:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别推我 - 关门\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't push me. - Door, close.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.03,0:24:59.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要让我发疯了 - 你才让我发疯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're driving me crazy. - You're driving me crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.37,0:25:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你让我… - 喔，闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're driving me… - Oh, shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.71,0:25:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Door, open.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.46,0:25:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 关门 - 我爱死了这东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Door, close. - I love this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.09,0:25:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,马文…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marv.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.63,0:25:12.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,门…怎么关上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The door was… shutting.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.13,0:25:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这东西怎么了？开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong with this thing? Door, open.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.44,0:25:25.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想这里有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think there's somebody here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.40,0:25:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人在吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.15,0:25:29.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喔，不要乱叫，嘘！ - 你才嘘！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, not now. Shh! - You shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.48,0:25:31.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你嘘！ - 你才嘘！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You shh! Shh, shh, shh, shh, shh. - You shh! Shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.07,0:25:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能王子早就来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe the prince came early.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.68,0:26:02.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.15,0:26:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他，快过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.49,0:26:22.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Oh! Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.45,0:27:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快走，宝贝 - 啊！马文！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, honey. - Uh! Marv!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.13,0:27:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔！喔！喔！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ow! Ow! Ow! Ow! Ow! Oh! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.43,0:27:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊， 啊， 啊， 啊， 啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ay, ay, ay, ay, ah! Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.27,0:27:30.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,普雷斯特先生！ 普雷斯特先生！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Prescott! Mr. Prescott!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.61,0:27:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是你！ - 你好，马文\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You! - Hello, Marv.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.95,0:27:41.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.82,0:27:44.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,好久不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}long time, no see.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.49,0:27:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对吧？小鬼 - 他是王子吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Huh, kid? - Is that the prince?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.70,0:27:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，他是凯文！凯文，薇拉 薇拉，凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that's Kevin. Kevin, Vera. Vera, Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.33,0:27:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他不是 我们马上离开这里吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if that ain't him, let's get outta here before somebody sees us.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.21,0:27:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们该采取别的行动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I think we got the lay of the land.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.71,0:27:57.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be back!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.71,0:27:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 走吧！ - 好啦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on! - Oh, all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.00,0:28:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,房子，自己清理\N{\fnArial\fs30}House, clean yourself up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.41,0:28:32.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，我应该试看看…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it was worth a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.63,0:28:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想，大家应该不会抓狂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, maybe they won't be too mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.38,0:28:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如我告诉他们刚才发生的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, once I tell them what happened…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.55,0:28:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们一定会谅解的\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe they'll be okay with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.85,0:28:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看来是不会… - 这是…这是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Or maybe not. - What… what…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.39,0:28:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}what…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.93,0:28:52.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}what…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.19,0:28:53.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是… - 这是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What… - What…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.31,0:28:58.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，我知道这里看里来乱七八糟 但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I know it looks bad, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.32,0:29:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝，这是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, what's the…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.36,0:29:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文，你…你… 你到底做了些什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin, what… what… what have you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.07,0:29:09.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,普雷斯特！ 普雷斯特！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prescott! Prescott!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.12,0:29:11.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这个坏掉了！我刚才试过了 - 有什么事吗？夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's not working. I tried. - Yes, ma'am?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.79,0:29:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来！马上过来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up here! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.25,0:29:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔，刚才真的坏掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it wasn't working.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.09,0:29:19.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文，到底是发生什么事了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.21,0:29:21.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我，是那些窃贼用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't me. It was the burglars.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.88,0:29:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 窃贼？ - 是的，我还认识其中一人，他叫马文\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The burglars? - Yeah. And I recognized the one guy. Marv.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.64,0:29:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这件事…我有告诉过你吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I ever tell you about him? Well, that's another story.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.10,0:29:31.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是他们想毁掉你们的房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the point is they were gonna rip off your house.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.27,0:29:34.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所以你就选择把它搞得一团乱 - 不，我只是想要保护这间房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So you chose instead to trash it? - No. I was trying to protect it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.85,0:29:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 搞得一团乱来保护它 - 为了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- By trashing it? - What in the name of…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.56,0:29:39.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，为什么我叫你的时候，你都不来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, why didn't you come when I was calling you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.53,0:29:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,普雷斯特…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prescott,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.07,0:29:44.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道今天这里有窃贼入侵吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were you aware of any burglars here today?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.99,0:29:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,窃贼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burglars?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.87,0:29:50.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道，夫人 所有的警报都很正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, ma'am. All the alarms were on as usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.04,0:29:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许是他们把它关掉的 我猜他们也有遥控器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe they turned 'em off. They had one of these, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.62,0:29:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起，夫人 我没有看见任何人进来，但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw no intruders, and except for… beg your pardon, ma'am…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.17,0:30:00.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到浴室的水龙头坏了 我一直都待在监视器前面\N{\fnArial\fs30}the briefest of bathroom breaks, my eyes were on the monitors at all times.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.00,0:30:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这小孩子怎么那么厉害 可以在短时间内把房子搞成这样…\N{\fnArial\fs30}How one child could do so much damage in the time it took me to…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.84,0:30:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喔，这超出我的理解范围了 - 真的不是我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- well, it's quite beyond me. - It wasn't me!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.01,0:30:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔，但这里没有其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there was no one else here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.26,0:30:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他在撒谎！ - 我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's lying! - Am not!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.60,0:30:11.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在撒谎！ - 没有！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are too! - Am not!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.85,0:30:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在撒谎 - 不管怎么说，先生…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are too! - With all due respect, sir,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.64,0:30:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的确看见凯文在遥控那些设备…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did see Master Kevin playing with the devices.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.69,0:30:19.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,把整个房子当作一个大玩具\N{\fnArial\fs30}as if the house were a big toy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.69,0:30:22.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里唯一的小屁孩就是你的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only hooligan here today was your son.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.28,0:30:24.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give us a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.49,0:30:29.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.63,0:30:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸爸… - 凯文，坐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Kevin, sit. - Dad, I…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.26,0:30:46.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,究竟是怎么一回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.42,0:30:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你说了，是窃贼闯进了这间房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you. The burglars broke into the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.72,0:30:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文，你知道我可以原谅你任何事情 但是除了撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin, you know I can forgive just about anything but lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.43,0:30:56.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔，所以如果我把这里搞得一团乱 你也不会生气吗？可是我并没有做…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, right. So you wouldn't get mad if I wrecked the place, which I didn't,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.23,0:30:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么硬要我承认… 那些我没做过的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}as long as I admit that I did, which I didn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.56,0:31:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔，我想事情都过去了，啊…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I thought this over and, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.49,0:31:08.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你很难控制\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand that this is a difficult adjustment for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.36,0:31:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你平常就很过动\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's only natural that you'd be acting out.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.62,0:31:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但是你得多注意一点 - 不，不是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's a need for attention. - No, it isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.33,0:31:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.12,0:31:15.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不论如何…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.37,0:31:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不论如何 反正也没什么损失？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, what's a little damage?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.54,0:31:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,还好有保险，不然就赔大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not as if I'm not insured.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.25,0:31:25.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还有什么要说的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, do you have something to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.09,0:31:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.13,0:31:30.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.22,0:31:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为这件事向你们道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry for the damage of your house.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.01,0:32:16.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,保全摄影机一定有录下了全部过程\N{\fnArial\fs30}Security cameras must have got the whole thing on tape.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.56,0:32:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.73,0:32:24.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是普雷斯特关掉了摄影机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prescott must have turned off the cameras.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.69,0:32:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是不可思议\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.74,0:32:34.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,真令人难以相信！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is not to be believed!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.83,0:32:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不敢相信这一切！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe this!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.70,0:32:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,又是那个该死的小鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the lousy kid again.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.21,0:32:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次都让我遇到他！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everywhere I break into!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.00,0:32:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像他老跟着我一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like he's stalking me or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.88,0:32:47.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔，马文 他只是一个小男孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Marv. He's just a little boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.75,0:32:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔，没错 但是那小鬼却给我大麻烦…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, I got big scars from that little…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.22,0:32:53.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.84,0:32:56.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你一件事…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you one thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.72,0:32:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一次绝对不会让他再来破坏我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}this time he's not gonna mess me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.31,0:33:02.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 - 这次一定都能完美\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mm-hmm. - This time it's all gonna go.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.31,0:33:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺利进行的\N{\fnArial\fs30}smooth as silk.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.94,0:33:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这一次…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because this time…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.86,0:33:09.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有一个内应\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got an inside man.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.99,0:33:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.25,0:33:23.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，嘿，嘿，嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hey, hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.75,0:33:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！嘿，来吧，来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Hey, come on! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.46,0:33:27.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意看路，安全第一！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch the road there! Safety first.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.57,0:33:58.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这里干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.49,0:34:02.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 告诉我 - 我…啊…我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tell me. - I, uh… I…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.62,0:34:06.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,没干什么，我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing. I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.79,0:34:09.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得这些东西很好玩 所以就来瞧瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just thought all of this was kinda cool, so I wanted to take a look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.59,0:34:12.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能擅自进入别人的房间 也不能乱碰别人的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't go to other people's homes uninvited,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.71,0:34:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没警告过你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you don't touch their things.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.97,0:34:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你再犯的话，我会怎样处置你吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't I warn you what would happen if I ever caught you in here again?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.18,0:34:19.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,并没有特别提到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not specifically.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.47,0:34:22.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.77,0:34:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那一定不会很好过的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It won't be pleasant.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.81,0:34:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有事吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.77,0:34:29.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听见那个孩子叫了啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I heard the boy. Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.52,0:34:30.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的听到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And indeed I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.90,0:34:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不希望他再扰乱你的工作 所以我要把他带走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want him bothering you anymore, so I'll just get him out of your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.95,0:34:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧，凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come along, Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.58,0:34:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在让我来照顾他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll be my responsibility from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.42,0:34:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你救我，茉莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for saving me, Molly.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.13,0:34:56.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,普雷斯特是一个让人保持距离的好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prescott is a good person to stay away from.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.63,0:34:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他其实是其中一个坏蛋…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're telling me. He's one of the bad guys…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.30,0:35:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,那群坏蛋破门而入\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bad guys who broke into the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.22,0:35:05.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实他们不算是破门而入 因为他们也有遥控器…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Although technically they didn't break in, because they had their own remote.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.14,0:35:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你觉得是谁给他们的？ - 普雷斯特？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And who do you think gave them that? - Prescott?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.52,0:35:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 - 真是令人难以置信！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mm-hmm. - That sounds a bit far-fetched to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.65,0:35:16.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白，你也许认为 我的想象力太过丰富\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. And you probably think I have an overactive imagination.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.24,0:35:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,大多数人都这么想 但是你一定要相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most people do. But you have to believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.49,0:35:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文，普雷斯特是一个孤独的人 他仅有的就是这份工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin, Prescott is a lonely man. The only thing he has is this job.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.58,0:35:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你说个小秘密 他讨厌在这里工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}And between you and me, he hates working here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.87,0:35:29.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 能做自己想做的事… - 这种感觉真的是太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But to do what you're suggesting… - Then it all makes perfect sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.33,0:35:33.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他讨厌这份工作 所以他才想要参与偷窃，然后离开这工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}He hates his job, so he tries to pull off a big heist so he can afford to quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.25,0:35:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 啊，我不知道 - 听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ah, I don't know. - Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.59,0:35:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他总是说我在撒谎 其实我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}He told my dad I was lying when I wasn't,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.09,0:35:41.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把保全摄影机关了 这能证明一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he shut off the security cameras, so it can only mean one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.97,0:35:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 证明什么 - 马文和他的新朋友…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And that is? - Marv and his new friend…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.27,0:35:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一个内应…\N{\fnArial\fs30}have an inside guy…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.10,0:35:48.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,普雷斯特！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prescott.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.81,0:35:51.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想你是对的 - 我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I think you're right. - I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.77,0:35:55.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错，你的想象力真的太过丰富\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. You do have an overactive imagination.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.49,0:35:59.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我就是喜欢小孩子的这一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that's what I love about children.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.90,0:36:04.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我儿子也和你一样… 就如同你的年纪一样调皮\N{\fnArial\fs30}My own son was the same as you at your age… a real handful.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.37,0:36:06.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,茉莉，你一定是个好母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must have been a great mom, Molly.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.54,0:36:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得控制好你的想象力，好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you just try to keep that imagination under control, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.51,0:36:20.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很清楚 今天发生了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were very understanding about what happened today.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.93,0:36:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文正在经历着一个艰困时刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Kevin's going through a difficult time.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.06,0:36:27.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你父母离婚时 你一定会难过的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not easy when your parents split up.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.10,0:36:28.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我，我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.10,0:36:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我们一定会度过的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we'll get through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.35,0:36:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会成为一个好继母的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna be a great stepmom.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.15,0:36:39.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该想办法 让他觉得这里更像个家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we just need to figure out a way to make him feel more at home here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.03,0:36:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许做些圣诞节的活动会好一些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe do some of the Christmas things he's used to doing,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.07,0:36:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如布置圣诞树\N{\fnArial\fs30}like trimming the tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.62,0:36:47.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你自己布置吗？ - 当然，我自己布置\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You do that yourself? - Yes, I do that myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.54,0:36:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,真有趣，这就是我们该做的事 我们来布置圣诞树\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's fun. That's exactly what we're gonna do. We're gonna trim the tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.42,0:36:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样我们可以团结在一起 让我们更像一个家\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll get us in the spirit of things, unite us as a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.38,0:36:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吗？ - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.59,0:37:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有朋友，没有欢笑，没有白雪\N{\fnArial\fs30}No friends, no fun, no snow.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.09,0:37:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次肯定会是一个 最糟糕的圣诞夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is definitely gonna be the worst Christmas ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.02,0:37:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，凯文，你还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Kev. How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.40,0:37:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们好像忘了今天应该做什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you say we just forget about today and start over, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.36,0:37:24.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是指？ - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You mean it? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.28,0:37:27.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实娜塔莉人很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Natalie's really a great person.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.99,0:37:29.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该多和她相处\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just gotta get to know her better.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.91,0:37:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们应该让这个家充满欢乐气氛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we should start having a little more fun around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.83,0:37:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我可以一起参与 - 真的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I could live with that. - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.42,0:37:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们马上来布置圣诞树吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't we start by trimming that tree?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.96,0:37:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在吗？ - 没错，马上行动吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now? - Sure. Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.03,0:38:50.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.91,0:38:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听不清楚 能把音乐关小声一点吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on, I can't hear you. Can you turn down the music?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.42,0:39:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,关掉音乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Music, off.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.25,0:39:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚才说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.38,0:39:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然，我们待会就到 绝对不会耽误的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, of course we'll be there. We wouldn't miss it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.72,0:39:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我等一下再给你回电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me call you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.22,0:39:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛格丽特正在市区报佳音 他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evangelista's in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.55,0:39:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,们打算待会约我们吃顿简单的晚餐…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Margaret's just throwing together a little impromptu supper,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.01,0:39:14.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以去吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we shouldn't go, should we?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.02,0:39:17.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊，不然你自己去，不用陪我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, wh-why don't you just go ahead without me,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.10,0:39:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和凯文要留在这里完成布置\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Kevin and I will finish up over here?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.90,0:39:20.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗？你不介意吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? You wouldn't mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.90,0:39:23.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然不会，毕竟他们也是你的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. They're your friends anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.90,0:39:26.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你人真好 我不会太晚回家的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're an angel. I won't be home late.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.12,0:39:31.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.58,0:39:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们布置到哪了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where were we?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.87,0:39:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不需要因为我而留下来 - 不，我是真心想要留下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You don't have to stay because of me. - No, I want to stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.42,0:39:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.17,0:39:41.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜塔莉她每晚都出去吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, does Natalie go out every night?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.29,0:39:44.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,她很常出去，她总是充满了热情…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty much. She leads a very exciting life…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.50,0:39:46.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至带给我前所未有的生活体验\N{\fnArial\fs30}more exciting than we're used to.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.88,0:39:49.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你不再感到枯燥乏味？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you'd say you're not in a rut?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.09,0:39:51.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，我不再感到枯燥乏味 怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm not in a rut. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.64,0:39:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想这就是你离开的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought maybe that's why you left.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.35,0:39:56.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文，凯文，你知道吗…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin. Kevin, you know…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.19,0:40:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我并不是为了和娜塔莉在一起 才离开你妈妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't leave your mom to be with Natalie, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.44,0:40:03.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然这种情况后来发生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That just kind of happened later.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.94,0:40:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想告诉我什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna tell me about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.74,0:40:10.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,大人的世界就是这么复杂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Adult relationships are just complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.78,0:40:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些人太早结婚 就像你妈妈和我一样…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes when two people get married really young like your mom and I did,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.45,0:40:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,到最后会有一种感觉…\N{\fnArial\fs30}you just end up feeling kind of…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.29,0:40:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好像错过了什么 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You missed out on some things. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.58,0:40:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个人外表长大成熟…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, just 'cause you grow up on the outside,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.83,0:40:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不代表你的内心世界不能拥有欢乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}doesn't mean you wanna stop having fun, enjoying life.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.13,0:40:26.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸，我知道有些人童心未泯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know all about the inner child, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.25,0:40:30.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喔，真的吗？ - 这就是为什么有些大人喜欢开跑车\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh. You do, huh? - That's why old guys drive sports cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.22,0:40:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能你是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're probably right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.14,0:40:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是跑车的问题是…没有其他人的空间\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the trouble with sports cars… no room for anybody else.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.39,0:40:38.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许最多能再多一个人的位置…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe one other person, max.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.43,0:40:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是如果你想体验一次真正的公路旅行…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you want to take a real road trip,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.48,0:40:43.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,就得带着行李等等… 并没有办法留位置给朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}with luggage and all, you don't even have room for a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.65,0:40:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些人也许过得很酷、很刺激…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, they're cool and fast and all,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.82,0:40:48.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是谁想要像他们一样 开着帅气的跑车，却是孤单一人呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}but who wants to be in a nice car when you're all alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.96,0:41:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，看起来真是完美\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that looks just about perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.63,0:41:11.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,只剩下把星星挂上去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All that's left to do now is put on the star.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.18,0:41:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文总是喜欢挂星星\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin always puts on the star.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.39,0:41:16.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错，他喜欢，不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right. He does, doesn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.55,0:41:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我总是举着他 然后给他开玩笑拉内裤\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I always hold him up, and then I give him a wedgie.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.39,0:41:22.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在那边大惊小怪 我们都笑翻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He makes a fuss. We all laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.35,0:41:27.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看我们今年得要用梯子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I guess we're just gonna have to use the ladder this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.94,0:41:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，爸爸 你可以把我放下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Dad, you can put me down now.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.11,0:41:36.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔，看起来真漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. Looks pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.87,0:41:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得看起来很棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it looks great.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.12,0:41:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想这是我们最棒的圣诞树了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's our best tree yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.08,0:41:46.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.34,0:41:53.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 圣诞快乐，妈妈 - 圣诞快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Merry Christmas, Mommy. - Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.63,0:41:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣诞快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.18,0:42:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔！快看！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.64,0:42:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿嘿 - 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey. Hey. - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.68,0:42:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把这个计算机芯片装在妈妈身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had this little computer chip installed in Mom,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.65,0:42:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正打算去找她来做早餐吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}and next Christmas, we're gonna get her to make some breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.49,0:42:18.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 早安 - 早安\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Morning. - Mornin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.50,0:42:27.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,早安，贪睡虫们 你们终于起床了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning, sleepyheads. You're finally up.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.38,0:42:29.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对我们的圣诞树做了什么啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do to our tree?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.42,0:42:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔，是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.34,0:42:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我每年都会叫人来布置圣诞树\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a standing appointment with the tree decorators every year,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.88,0:42:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为最近过得太开心了 所以我忘记取消了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and in all the excitement, I forgot to cancel.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.97,0:42:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能原谅我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you ever gonna forgive me?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.64,0:42:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拆掉了我们的树吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You undid our tree?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.51,0:42:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正它最后还是要被拆掉的啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it would have had to come down eventually anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.06,0:42:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，凯文 来看看这些礼物，怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, come on, Kev. Look at all these presents, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.85,0:42:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔，来看，这有一件大礼物 我相信这件是属于…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, wait. Ooh, here's a big one. I believe it has…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.86,0:42:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错，上面有你的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}yes, it has your name on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.57,0:42:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来拆开它 这是我和娜塔莉送给你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Why don't you open it up? It's from Natalie and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.86,0:42:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能明天圣诞节的时候再打开吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But shouldn't I open it tomorrow on Christmas?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.78,0:43:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明天还有更多礼物呢 来吧，不要弄坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, you got plenty to open tomorrow. Come on. One won't hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.74,0:43:02.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.62,0:43:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,超级间谍 窃听器和收听装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}Super spy bugging and listening device.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.08,0:43:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不酷吗？ - 很酷！谢谢你，爸爸！谢谢你，娜塔莉！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Isn't that cool? - Yeah. Thanks, Dad. Thanks, Natalie.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.96,0:43:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很高兴你有喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad you like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.14,0:43:23.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿，妈妈，你要去哪？ - 我给凯文送点东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, Mom, where you going? - I'm going to take Kevin some things.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.93,0:43:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈，你要去哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom, where you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.10,0:43:26.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没有干净的衣服…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't have any clean clothes with him,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.73,0:43:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我肯定他也没有玩具可玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm sure he doesn't have any toys to play with.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.23,0:43:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺便去检查一下爸爸的女朋友，想去吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}To check out Dad's girlfriend. Wanna go?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.83,0:43:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有什么需要帮忙的吗？ - 喔！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- May I help you? - Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.62,0:43:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来找凯文·麦卡斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here for Kevin McCallister.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.16,0:43:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喔！ - 巴兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wow! - Buzz.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.54,0:43:49.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是来这里带他回家的吗？ - 不是，我有些东西要给他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you here to take him home? - No, I have something for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.79,0:43:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,请往这边走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.54,0:43:54.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该听的到这声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should be able to hear on that. Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.75,0:43:57.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我听起来怎么样啊 - 孩子们，跟近一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How do I sound? - Kids, stay close.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.84,0:44:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妈妈！ - 嘿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mom! - Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.68,0:44:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.97,0:44:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈！啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm! Ohh!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.60,0:44:10.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们还记得娜塔莉吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you guys remember Natalie, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.35,0:44:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 巴兹、梅根 - 嗨，娜塔莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi, Buzz, Megan. - Hi, Natalie.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.02,0:44:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔，凯特，这是娜塔莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and, uh, Kate, this is Natalie.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.69,0:44:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 娜塔莉，这是凯特 - 你好，凯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Natalie, Kate. - Hello, Kate.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.19,0:44:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.78,0:44:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们想要待一会吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, are you guys gonna stay?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.37,0:44:25.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，我只是给你送一些东西过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, I just brought you some of your stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.49,0:44:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们可以参观这房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys gotta see this house.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.70,0:44:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可以吗？娜塔莉 - 当然，你们是我的客人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is that okay, Natalie? - Of course. Be my guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.17,0:44:35.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好美的树啊 - 它本来更好看\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Awesome tree! - It used to look better.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.75,0:44:37.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你头上戴的是什么啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, what is this thing on your head?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.38,0:44:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是间谍工具，娜塔莉送给我的圣诞礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a spy kit that Natalie got me for an early Christmas present,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.34,0:44:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 太酷了 - 真的吗？这真的很适合你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And it's so cool. - Really? That was nice of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.39,0:44:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很喜欢你的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm very fond of your kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.43,0:44:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带你们见识一下 她送给我的飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've gotta show you this airplane that she got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.52,0:44:54.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,要喝杯咖啡吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like a cup of coffee?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.65,0:44:57.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔，不用了，谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.48,0:44:59.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, uh, didn't know he would have.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.53,0:45:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他有这么多的玩具 - 是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- all this stuff to play with. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.28,0:45:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔，天啊，给我看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, god. Hey. Let me… let me get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.32,0:45:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道没有这个 他睡不睡得着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't even sure he could even sleep without it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.66,0:45:07.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕，你知道吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gosh, you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.79,0:45:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他竟然都没提起过这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot believe he hasn't even asked for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.37,0:45:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 我们也能买其他的绒毛动物娃娃给他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we could buy him another stuffed animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.83,0:45:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喔，不，不 - 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, no, no. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.58,0:45:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就是这个，他的泰迪熊 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is, uh… this is Teddy. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.50,0:45:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰迪熊一直是他的好朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Teddy is his transitional object.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.84,0:45:19.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.05,0:45:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,好朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Transitional object.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.01,0:45:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像小孩子随身 携带的东西一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like something very, very special a child carries with him everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.76,0:45:27.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该留一个备用\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're actually… you're supposed to have a spare,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.51,0:45:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,以防万一\N{\fnArial\fs30}in case something happens to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.93,0:45:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 当然，我们就只有这一个，还记得吗？ - 喔！我怎么会忘记呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Of course, we only had one, remember? - Oh! How could I forget?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.56,0:45:34.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有一次在高速公路上开快车\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were driving down the highway,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.02,0:45:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那次真的有急事\N{\fnArial\fs30}like, really in a hurry, going somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.90,0:45:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, Kevin thinks,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.07,0:45:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰迪熊需要一点新鲜空气\N{\fnArial\fs30}oh, possibly Teddy might want a little fresh air, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.24,0:45:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他把车窗摇下来 然后泰迪熊就飞出去了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he rolls down the window, and out flies Teddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.95,0:45:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就突然失去理智！ 他一直哭，而且非常沮丧\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was ballistic. He was crying. He was so upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.12,0:45:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是…喔，我的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was… oh, my…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.20,0:45:50.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以彼得把车停到路边 然后我下车找到小熊\N{\fnArial\fs30}So Peter pulls over, and I get out to retrieve the bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.62,0:45:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我到现在都不敢相信你竟然找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still can't believe you did that.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.37,0:45:56.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,还好是在慢车道 没有太多的车子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it was the slow lane, and there wasn't much traffic.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.25,0:45:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果没有了这只小熊 我真不知道他会怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, I don't know what he would have done if he had lost it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.09,0:46:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想凯文和王子在一起 一定会玩到很开心的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I think Kevin's gonna have so much fun playing with the prince…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.10,0:46:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他甚至不会去想念绒毛动物娃娃\N{\fnArial\fs30}that he's not even gonna miss the stuffed animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.06,0:46:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这房子里面全是孩子 这一定很美好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's going to be so wonderful having a house full of children.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.77,0:46:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我非常期待有那么一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm looking forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.31,0:46:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们，小心花园的雕像\N{\fnArial\fs30}Children, watch the garden sculpture!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.06,0:46:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔，我想我得快点离开…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I… better get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.94,0:46:23.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我，是凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't me! It was Kevin!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.66,0:46:27.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然他们可能会弄坏什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before they break something.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.62,0:46:36.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔，我们马上要去机场接皇室成员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we're off to the airport to pick up the royal family.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.33,0:46:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们知道这是多么重要的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all know how important this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.96,0:46:41.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,宴会服务人员马上就来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, the caterers will be here momentarily.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.17,0:46:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,而宾客们都会提前一个小时到达…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the guests will arrive about an hour before.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.51,0:46:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你们和皇室成员看到隆重盛大的场面\N{\fnArial\fs30}you and the royals make your grand entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.38,0:46:46.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用担心…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No need to worry, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.01,0:46:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都能顺利进行的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything will be taken care of.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.47,0:46:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,但愿一切都能事事顺利\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just that I want everything to go right.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.68,0:46:53.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧，我们不能迟到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Let's not be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.31,0:46:56.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不希望有出任何的差错 开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want one single thing to go wrong. Door, open.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.73,0:46:58.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对不能出差错\N{\fnArial\fs30}And nothing will.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.35,0:47:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔，太好了！你们终于来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, good. You've finally arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.91,0:47:58.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 普雷斯特先生！普雷斯特先生！就是他们！ - 安静\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mr. Prescott! Mr. Prescott! It's them! - Hush, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.46,0:48:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我马上带他离开 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll get him out of your way. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.50,0:48:04.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就是那天的窃贼！ 就是他们啊！普雷斯特先生！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the burglars! It's the burglars! Aah! Mr. Prescott!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.21,0:48:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,是马文！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Marv!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.80,0:48:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我猜你早就知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess you already knew that though.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.05,0:48:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你！仔细听着！ 我已经受够了你的闹剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, you. I have just about had enough of you and your melodrama!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.85,0:48:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚的宴会非常重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, This is a very important night,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.77,0:48:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如有必要的话，我会把你关起来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and if I have to lock you up to keep you out of our way,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.98,0:48:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别以为我不敢！ - 看！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- don't think I won't do it. - Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.77,0:48:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.31,0:48:26.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔！喔！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ow. Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.86,0:48:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,别烦我！你这个小鬼！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't trifle with me, you demon spawn!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.66,0:48:35.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,藏在这个地方真是愚蠢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that's a foolish place to hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.92,0:48:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,解决一个了，还有两个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}One down, two to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.68,0:48:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,放我出去！放我出去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me out of here! Let me out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.64,0:48:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里很冷！放我出去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's freezing cold back here! Let me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.20,0:49:14.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文，你有看见普雷斯特了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin, have you seen Prescott?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.66,0:49:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有看到 - 啊，他每次都这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not lately. - Ah, typical.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.58,0:49:18.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你不需要他的时候，他总是在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always poking around when you don't want him,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.79,0:49:20.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你需要他的时候…却找不到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}and when you need him, nowhere to be found.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.83,0:49:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！客人已经来了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah! Guests already?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.17,0:49:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么没有礼貌性迟到呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever happened to fashionably late?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.71,0:49:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔，我不想自夸，但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I don't like to boast, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.38,0:49:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错，这是一场隆重盛大的宴会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, it will be the party of the season.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.76,0:49:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔，我要接另外一通电话 好的，再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm getting another call. All right. See you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.43,0:49:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.52,0:49:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡梅利娜，你好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carmelina, how are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.31,0:49:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？喔，不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.94,0:49:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们被大雪困住了 航班也已经取消\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're snowed in. Their flight's been canceled.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.57,0:49:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔，真令人沮丧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, so am I. Devastated.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.45,0:49:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔，好吧，明天见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, all right. We'll see you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.16,0:49:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣诞快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.50,0:50:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在该怎么办？ 今晚只能算是普通的宴会\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we gonna do now? It's gonna be just an ordinary party.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.04,0:50:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,与你一起度过的圣诞夜 对我而言绝不平凡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Christmas Eve at your place sounds anything but ordinary to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.88,0:50:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这根本不能算是隆重盛大的宴会\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's hardly the party of the season.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.38,0:50:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.68,0:50:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如今晚来宣布我们的婚事，怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if we announce our engagement tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.81,0:50:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.97,0:50:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我们还要等到 你完成离婚手续…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know we were gonna wait till after your divorce was final, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.98,0:50:27.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是也只需要再几个星期了… 而且你的孩子也都知道了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, it's only a few weeks away and your kids already know,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.15,0:50:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会让今晚的宴会与众不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it'll make tonight so special.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.44,0:50:31.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，只要能让你高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if it makes you happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.82,0:50:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.04,0:50:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些家伙跑到哪里了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are those guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.91,0:50:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 马文，我想要尿尿 - 薇拉，你下个星期再尿吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Marv, I gotta tinkle. - Vera, you can tinkle next week.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.33,0:50:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可真会找时间！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always in a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.34,0:50:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Door, open.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.30,0:50:57.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，你还记得那个计划吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Now, you remember the plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.26,0:51:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哪个计划？哈利的计划吗？ - 什么…不，不是哈利的计划！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Which plan? Harry's plan? - What? No! Not Harry's plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.56,0:51:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就是那个使用绳子和袋子的计划！ - 你为什么要对我大吼大叫？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The one involving rope and a bag! - Why are you yelling at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.22,0:51:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有大吼大叫…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not yell…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.27,0:51:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你想起那个计划了吗？ - 想起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you remember the plan? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.81,0:51:10.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在，当王子上床去睡觉时… - 我们就把他绑进在袋子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now, when the prince comes up to bed… - We bag him!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.98,0:51:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没错，我们要绑架那个小孩 - 你真是个天才，马文\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's right. We kidnap the kid napping. - You're a genius, Marv.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.61,0:51:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错，开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right. Door, open.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.12,0:51:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,当王子进了袋子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, the prince goes in the bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.29,0:51:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 然后我们就把袋子扔出窗户 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The bag goes out the window. - Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.21,0:51:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着，我们顺着绳子爬下去 关门\N{\fnArial\fs30}We climb down the rope. Door, close.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.17,0:51:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.25,0:51:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后，大家都进到车子里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody in the van…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.63,0:51:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,在别人发现之前，我们早就离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're gone before they know what hit 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.97,0:51:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是完美的计划，马文 既优雅又精简\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beautiful plan, Marv. Elegant in its simplicity.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.06,0:51:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的，我们现在来试试看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. All right. Let's try it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.27,0:51:47.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你进去袋子里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in the bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.19,0:51:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我？为什么不是你进去袋子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me? Why don't you get in the bag?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.27,0:51:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我是老大 进去袋子里，薇拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I'm the boss. Get in the bag, Vera.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.48,0:51:54.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不想进去袋子里面 - 薇拉，进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't wanna get in the bag. - Vera, just get in the bag! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.78,0:51:56.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没跟我说过要进去袋子里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't tell me I was gonna get in no bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.90,0:51:59.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要制造一些神秘，这样才会有趣 喔，我在袋子里面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was saving it. It's gonna be fun. See, we're in the bag!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.08,0:52:03.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了，真棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.50,0:52:06.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开窗户\N{\fnArial\fs30}Window, open.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.83,0:52:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ahh.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.59,0:52:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,马文，喔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, Marv. Ooh. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.59,0:52:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的，不用担心，我有抓紧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, honey. I got ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.38,0:52:21.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,马文！让我慢慢地下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marv! Let me down easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.89,0:52:25.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝，我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always do, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.18,0:52:26.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不应该想的太轻而易举\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shouldn't have had that last piece of cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.27,0:52:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ahh…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.48,0:52:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.23,0:52:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Door, open.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.87,0:52:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.37,0:52:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都在我掌握之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything's under control.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.75,0:52:49.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔，马文…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, uh, Marv…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.84,0:52:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,太简单了，但还是很酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy, but still way cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.76,0:53:08.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你帮我垫背，宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for breaking my fall, pumpkin.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.27,0:53:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我总是如此，宝贝，好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always do, baby. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.56,0:53:12.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我离开这里！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out and stay out!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.03,0:53:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道你们想要干什么？ - 喔！聪明的小鬼，是什么啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I know what you're trying to do. - Oh, yeah, wise guy? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.86,0:53:24.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们想要绑架王子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're trying to kidnap the prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.29,0:53:32.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴，你这个小白痴！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up, ya little moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.42,0:53:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要杀了他 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm gonna kill him. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.64,0:53:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooph!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.18,0:53:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,薇拉，亲爱的，需要帮忙吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vera, honey. Little help?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.77,0:53:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔，宝贝！太好了，我非常需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, baby. That'd be great. I sure could use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.61,0:54:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听得一清二楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got every word.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.74,0:54:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ow. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.46,0:54:15.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 欢迎回来，怎么没看见皇室成员？ - 他们被大雪困住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Welcome back. Where's the royal family? - They were snowed in.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.75,0:54:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 啊！ - 普雷斯特在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ah! - Where's Prescott?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.34,0:54:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我到处都找不到他 - 真是奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can't find him anywhere. - That's odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.09,0:54:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系，茉莉 给每位宾客上香槟喝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Molly, make sure everyone has champagne.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.38,0:54:25.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有一件重大的事情要宣布\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going to make a special announcement.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.97,0:54:27.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的，夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.98,0:54:43.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好吗？ - 很高兴再见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How are you? - Hi, how are you? Good to see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.07,0:54:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位来宾，大家能看我这边吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone, may I have your attention?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.53,0:54:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,哼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.29,0:54:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am gonna kill that…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.08,0:54:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uuh!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.73,0:55:18.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天是个很特别的夜晚 有件重大的事情要宣布\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is always a special night, and tonight may be even more special.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.40,0:55:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住他！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.69,0:55:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.11,0:55:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得和我要订婚了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter and I are engaged!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.21,0:55:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,普雷斯特？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prescott?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.01,0:55:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想情况不可能比现在更糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This could not be goin' worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.55,0:55:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,马文，你很旺喔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marv, you're on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.47,0:55:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔，谢谢你，宝贝 你自己也不差啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thanks, baby. You're not so bad yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.77,0:55:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，亲爱的 是身上着火烧到旺了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sweetheart. You're really on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.77,0:55:59.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，我正在想办法 你知道…啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I try to work out. You know… aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.85,0:56:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gaah! Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.27,0:56:06.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哇！哇！哇！ - 凯文！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Whoo! Whoo! Whoo! - Kevin!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.49,0:56:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有说谎 那些坏人又回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not lying. The bad guys are back.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.33,0:56:16.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到处都没有找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not getting anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.33,0:56:21.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文，我问了所有服务生和茉莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin, I spoke to all the caterers and to Molly.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.46,0:56:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了你之外没有人看见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody saw a thing but you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.80,0:56:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这怎么可能？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, how could that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.76,0:56:29.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 但是我听到他们说要绑架王子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, but I heard they're gonna kidnap the prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.93,0:56:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你真的听到他们这么说 - 是的，我用窃听装置听到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You heard them say that? - Yeah, with my super spy bugging device.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.76,0:56:35.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且普雷斯特也参与了这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Prescott's involved with the whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.68,0:56:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太荒谬了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is absurd.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.60,0:56:39.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要打电话确认一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to call and make sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.81,0:56:41.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天皇室成员的班机有没有问题？\N{\fnArial\fs30}the royal family's flight is okay for tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.11,0:56:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文，我知道这是怎么一回事了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin, I know what's going on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.44,0:56:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的吗？ - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You do? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.74,0:56:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想破坏我和娜塔莉之间的关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're out to destroy my relationship with Natalie.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.20,0:56:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？ - 你知道今晚对她很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - You knew how important.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.28,0:56:56.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你就来捣蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}tonight was to her, and you went and pulled a crazy stunt like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.83,0:56:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不是这样的 - 我已经给了你很多机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's not the truth. - I've given you a lot of leeway,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.29,0:57:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我知道你很难接受 我和你妈妈离婚的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I know how tough this divorce has been on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.83,0:57:04.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是今晚，你实在是太过分了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But tonight you went way too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.80,0:57:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你回到自己的房间，好好的反省一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to go to your room and think about what you've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.51,0:57:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你向娜塔莉道歉之后 我会找你谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when you're ready to apologize to Natalie, then we'll talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.23,0:57:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,关门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Door, close.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.78,0:57:38.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔治！你在这里啊，圣诞快乐！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you are, George! Merry Christmas!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.30,0:57:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喂？ - 是妈妈吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello? - Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.92,0:57:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.22,0:57:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔，凯文 我很高兴你打电话过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Kevin. I'm so glad you called.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.80,0:57:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.39,0:58:00.93,Title,0,0,0,0,,我很好，我正在看电影《风云人物》\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah. I'm just watching It's a Wonderful Life.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.98,0:58:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吗？ - 你知道我多么喜欢这部电影\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You are? - You know how that gets to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.48,0:58:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在哪个频道？ - 第八频道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What channel is it on? - Eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.95,0:58:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ohh.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.78,0:58:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是喜欢这种完美结局的电影\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I'm just a sucker for happy endings.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.83,0:58:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚的宴会如何？ 你过得很开心吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how's your party? Are you havin' a good time?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.08,0:58:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错，一切都很棒！ 那你呢？圣诞夜有开心吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's all right. How about you? Havin' a good Christmas Eve?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.97,0:58:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，很开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. It's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.39,0:58:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我爱你！凯文 - 我也爱你，妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I love you, Kevin. - Love you too, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.14,0:58:43.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣诞快乐！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.73,0:58:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 圣诞快乐 - 好了，再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Merry Christmas. - Okay. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.96,0:59:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 凯文，你还没睡吗？ - 是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Kevin, are you awake? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.51,0:59:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚才的事，我们把你骂得很凶 你现在人没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father and I were a little rough on you before. Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.09,0:59:16.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没事 - 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.22,0:59:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为如果你再犯错一次 你就会被赶出这栋房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because if you ever do anything like that again,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.26,0:59:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你的人生晕头转向\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'll be out of this house so fast, your head will spin.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.27,0:59:24.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的父母亲要离婚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So your father's getting divorced. Boo-hoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.44,0:59:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但很多人的父母亲也都离婚了，这就是人生，你要去接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone's parents get divorced. That's life. You'll get over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.44,0:59:30.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你不能破坏我和你父亲的感情\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're not gonna come between your father and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.57,0:59:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲想把你留在身边 我也很赞成\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants you in his life, and I think that's admirable.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.11,0:59:36.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想跟他住在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you want him in your life…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.86,0:59:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好别找我麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}you better not cross me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.12,0:59:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,听清楚了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Understood?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.16,0:59:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.71,0:59:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明天早上会叫人把窗户修好 祝你有个好梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll have that window fixed first thing in the morning. Sweet dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.17,0:59:59.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们镇里最有钱的人 我的大哥乔治\N{\fnArial\fs30}To my big brother, George, the richest man in town.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.93,1:00:05.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚才和凯文好好的聊了一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've just had a nice little chat with Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.98,1:00:08.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们开始认识对方了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we're beginning to understand each other better.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.11,1:00:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在看什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you watching?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.06,1:00:14.15,Title,0,0,0,0,,是电影《风云人物》 这要演一整晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a Wonderful Life. They've been running it all night.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.19,1:00:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来和我一起看吧 - 我已经看过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. Watch it with me. - I've seen it.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.44,1:00:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那又怎么样？ - 怎么样…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So? - So…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.66,1:00:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白怎么会有人反复地看同一部电影？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand people who watch movies over and over again.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.45,1:00:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看过了，也哭过了 因此一次就够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw it. I cried. Once was enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.00,1:00:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是在开玩笑吧 凯特和我每年都和孩子们一起看的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta be kidding. Kate and I watch this every year with the kids.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.08,1:00:30.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们的家庭传统\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a family tradition.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.50,1:00:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.25,1:00:35.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你将要拥有一个新的家庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that you're going to have a new family,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.88,1:00:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许需要新的传统\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe it's time for some new traditions.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.10,1:00:51.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们一定会回来的 如果没有人相信我的话…\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll be back. And if no one believes me,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.40,1:00:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就自己去抓他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll have to catch 'em myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.75,1:01:17.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴，你这个小白痴！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up, you little moron.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.76,1:01:24.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴，你这个白痴！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up, you moron.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.64,1:01:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，停止\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.35,1:01:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,转得更快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spin faster.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.82,1:01:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,到袋子里去 闭嘴，你这蠢蛋！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in the bag. Shut up, ya bag!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.00,1:01:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 圣诞节的早晨到了 - 圣诞快乐，凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Christmas morning. - Merry Christmas, Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.38,1:01:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 圣诞快乐，爸爸 - 嘿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Merry Christmas, Dad! - Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.05,1:02:02.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 彼得，你准备好出发了吗 - 出发？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Peter, are you ready to go? - Go?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.55,1:02:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要去哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go where?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.35,1:02:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文 娜塔莉和我要去接皇室成员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin, Natalie and I gotta go pick up the royal family right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.02,1:02:12.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在？但是我们还没有拆礼物啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now? But aren't we gonna open presents?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.60,1:02:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我们回来再拆\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna have to wait till we get back.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.15,1:02:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这是圣诞节 为什么一定要两个人去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's Christmas. And why do you both have to go?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.57,1:02:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道，有些事情就算不想做也得去做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you know how sometimes you gotta do things you don't wanna do?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.11,1:02:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,而这件事就是其中之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is one of those times.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.41,1:02:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们很快就会回来的，这样可以吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, we'll be back before you know it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.82,1:02:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信在我们离开的这段时间 不会出任何的差错，对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm sure nothing will happen while we're gone. Am I right?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.33,1:02:29.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没错 - 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Right. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.79,1:02:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,待在这里，我们马上就回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang in there. We won't be long.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.29,1:02:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Door, open.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.84,1:02:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣诞快乐，凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merry Christmas, Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.14,1:02:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣诞快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.86,1:03:05.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.41,1:03:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不，我们没睡 - 不是我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, we're awake. - It wasn't me!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.08,1:03:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘘！好，我们正要行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shh! All right. We're on our way.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.29,1:03:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这让我好紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oy. Sure makes me nervous.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.63,1:03:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走，亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go, pookie.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.22,1:03:28.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道，他们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew it. Here they come.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.65,1:03:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先要干掉内应…\N{\fnArial\fs30}First step, eliminate the inside man.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.61,1:03:43.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔，普雷斯特先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Mr. Prescott?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.65,1:03:46.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,普雷斯特先生，你在吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Prescott, are you in there?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.82,1:03:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在 - 普雷斯特先生…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes. - Mr. Prescott,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.91,1:03:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你可以帮我的忙吗？ - 什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- can you help me with something? - And what would that be?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.66,1:03:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 又要喝奶昔，是吗？ - 不，我要一瓶酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Another milk shake, perhaps? - No. A bottle of wine.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.54,1:03:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？ - 娜塔莉说我们要去地下室拿酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Excuse me? - Natalie said we need to get.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.25,1:03:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为今天皇室成员要来\N{\fnArial\fs30}some wine from the basement for the royal family.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.13,1:04:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你是说实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we must.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.13,1:04:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你是对的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I guess you're right.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.76,1:04:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,今年的圣诞节不会下雪\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not gonna have any snow this Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.80,1:04:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,人的期望越少，就越不会出错\N{\fnArial\fs30}One can never go wrong with low expectations.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.89,1:04:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗？普雷斯特先生 和你相处的这几天\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Mr. Prescott, it's been great.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.48,1:04:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的很愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}spending time with you these last few days.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.52,1:04:19.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,快乐的时间总是过得很快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time flies when you're having fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.56,1:04:25.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我们一开始相处得不好 但现在有变好了，而且越来越好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know we got off to a bad start, but things can be better, much better.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.74,1:04:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你会困在下面，而我会留在上面\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause you're down there, and I'm up here.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.82,1:04:31.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.95,1:04:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,小家伙，开门！让我出去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Young man, open this door! Let me out of here!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.95,1:04:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喔！孩子！ - 喔！真开心见到你！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh! - Oh, boy! Am I glad to see you!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.21,1:04:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些绑匪要来了 但是这次我有先作准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}The kidnappers are coming, but this time I'm one step ahead of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.58,1:04:42.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把他们的同伙锁在地下室了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I locked their accomplice in the basement.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.21,1:04:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个完美的计划吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this a perfect plan, or what?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.80,1:04:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,几乎完美，亲爱的，但是你弄错了一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would be, dear, except for one thing…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.96,1:04:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,普雷斯特并不是他们的同伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prescott is not their accomplice.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.01,1:04:53.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.85,1:04:58.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你…你是他们的内应？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're… you're the inside man?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.02,1:04:59.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid so.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.40,1:05:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨，妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.48,1:05:05.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're here.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.99,1:05:08.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔，是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.03,1:05:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妈妈？他是你的儿子 - 我跟你说过，我儿子是个调皮的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- "Mom"? He's your son? - I told you he was a handful.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.41,1:05:17.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在，快点！ - 啊！放开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Aah! Hey! Get off of me! - Oh, now, come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.67,1:05:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有暗门或是其他东西吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't there a trapdoor or something?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.21,1:05:27.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有，对一个酒窖来说那没有必要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Not much demand for 'em in a wine cellar.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.42,1:05:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess you're right.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.18,1:05:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么办法吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got any good ideas?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.64,1:05:36.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a one.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.86,1:05:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我有一部手机 - 太好了，我可以用吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I do have a cell phone though. - Perfect! May I?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.15,1:05:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 当然可以 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sure. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.74,1:05:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喂，是巴兹吗？ - 凯文，是你吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello, Buzz? - Kevin, is that you?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.95,1:06:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没错，我是用手机打电话给你的 - 喔，是用手机\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. I'm calling from a cell phone. - Oh, a cell phone.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.75,1:06:03.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是太棒了，讨厌鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good for you, puke-face.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.17,1:06:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,又是她给你的礼物吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that another present she gave you?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.96,1:06:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,真会炫耀\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a showoff.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.71,1:06:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再打一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll try again.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.55,1:06:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴兹，你先别挂电话 我跟你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buzz, before you hang up, I need to tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.22,1:06:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要找妈妈讲电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to talk to Mom.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.72,1:06:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，你已经跟我说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. You told me.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.73,1:06:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我待会再打好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll try again later.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.57,1:06:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么会认为我是内应呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why in heaven's name did you think I was the inside man?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.07,1:06:35.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你表现得古怪 所以我就以为你是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if you hadn't acted so strange, I wouldn't have thought you were…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.78,1:06:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,内应\N{\fnArial\fs30}so strange.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.66,1:06:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些人第一次进来的时候 你人在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And where were you the first time these guys broke in?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.83,1:06:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么不回应对讲机？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you answer the intercom?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.75,1:06:45.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又为什么关掉摄影机？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you shut off the cameras?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.71,1:06:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我并没有 但如果这些歹徒利用茉莉的遥控器…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't. But if those thugs were using Molly's remote,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.21,1:06:50.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就可以关掉整个保全系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}they could've turned off the whole security system.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.96,1:06:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那你为什么认为我在说谎？ - 因为我认为只有你在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But why'd you say I was lying? - Well, because I thought you were.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.09,1:06:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且，我也不想让娜塔莉夫人知道…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And besides, I didn't want Miss Natalie to know that I'd been…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.60,1:07:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在偷懒\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, napping on the job.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.97,1:07:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果可以的话，那个女人会叫我 一天工作二十四个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}That woman. If she could work me 24 hours a day, she would.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.48,1:07:08.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这实在是太不人道了 所以当她不在的时候，我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's downright inhuman, so whenever she's not here, I, uh…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.65,1:07:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你会偷偷的占便宜… - 我只是稍微休息一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You take advantage. - I take a break.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.94,1:07:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,享受一下我应得的休闲时刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}A nice, well-deserved break.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.53,1:07:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我才没注意到 全部的摄影机和对讲机都被关掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}With all the cameras and intercoms turned off, I didn't notice anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.66,1:07:20.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 因此我… - 你掩盖了你的过失！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So I… - You were covering your "whoo-hoo"!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.91,1:07:23.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Precisely.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.79,1:07:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还想打电话给你妈吗？ - 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You want to try calling your mom again? - Sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.34,1:07:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喂？ - 妈妈？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello? - Mom?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.01,1:07:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.80,1:07:37.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等，凯文，我听不到你的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Kevin, I can't hear you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.39,1:07:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是因为我被锁在酒窖里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's probably 'cause I'm locked in a wine cellar.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.30,1:07:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，亲爱的 我听不到你的声音，噪音太吵了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I… honey, I can't hear you. There's too much static.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.10,1:07:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被锁在娜塔莉的酒窖里了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm locked in Natalie's wine cellar!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.60,1:07:47.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是打电话来说圣诞快乐吗？ - 妈妈，你有听到吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you calling to say Merry Christmas? - Mom, are you there?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.06,1:07:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 宝贝？ - 你有听到吗？妈妈？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sweetheart? - Are you there, Mom?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.40,1:07:50.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 凯文？ - 妈妈？妈妈？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Kevin? - Mom? Mom?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.11,1:07:54.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔，真糟糕！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, great!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.99,1:07:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,没电了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The battery's dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.37,1:08:02.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.46,1:08:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是卡尔班的宅邸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kalban residence.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.80,1:08:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨，我是凯特·麦卡斯特，凯文的妈妈 可以找一下凯文吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, this is Kate McCallister, Kevin's mom. May I speak to him, please?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.34,1:08:22.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 凯文现在人不在 - 这就奇怪了，他才刚打电话给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Kevin's not here right now. - That's strange. He just called.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.81,1:08:28.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗？对了 他和他爸爸以及娜塔莉小姐出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? Well, he's out with his father and Miss Natalie.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.35,1:08:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔，他一定是用他爸爸手机打的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Oh, he must have called from his dad's cell phone.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.81,1:08:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能收讯不好，所以断线了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that explains the line going dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.57,1:08:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.54,1:08:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这小鬼打电话给他妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little rascal called his mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.41,1:08:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 需要我让他看看，谁才是老大？ - 坐下，马文\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You want me to go show him who's boss? - Sit down, Marv.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.75,1:08:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是老大，我才是老大\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not the boss. I'm the boss.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.13,1:08:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.97,1:09:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然他的手机断线了 我不认为他还能给我们捣乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}His cell phone is dead. I don't think he'll be any more trouble.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.31,1:09:12.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.36,1:09:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是吃饼干\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cookie.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.69,1:09:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.24,1:09:22.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.53,1:09:24.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得，是我，我打电话给凯文 我们刚刚断线了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter, it's me. I'm calling Kevin back. We got disconnected.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.04,1:09:27.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文？ 凯文没有和在我一起 他人在娜塔莉的房子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin? Kevin's not with me. He's… he's back at Natalie's house.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.91,1:09:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗？ 有人跟我说你们在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? I was just told he's with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.96,1:09:34.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了…好了 别担心，我相信一切都没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well… well, don't worry, Kate. I mean, I'm sure everything's fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.71,1:09:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.42,1:09:40.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔，真是奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow, that's weird.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.51,1:09:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有人告诉凯特说，凯文正和我们在一起 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Someone told Kate that Kevin's with us. - Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.97,1:09:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们最好回去看看 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maybe I better go back and check on him. - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.68,1:09:51.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就是想要你这样 彼得，他在操纵你\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's exactly what he wants. Peter, he's manipulating you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.39,1:09:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没发觉每次都这样子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't you see the pattern?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.44,1:09:54.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要我们一出门，他就会扯后腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every time we leave the house, he pulls something.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.56,1:09:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就是想吸引你的注意 并且破坏我们的感情\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's just trying to get your attention and sabotage me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.82,1:10:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂！有人在外面吗？喂！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello! Anybody out there? Hello!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.62,1:10:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须想办法离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's gotta be something that we can do to get outta here.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.96,1:10:20.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.18,1:10:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 帮我搬这些箱子 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Help me move these boxes. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.35,1:10:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那后面有什么呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what's back there?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.81,1:10:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个好问题！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Definitely not a dumb question.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.64,1:10:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是食物升降机！ - 答对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The dumbwaiter! - Bingo.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.02,1:10:37.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 希望它还能运作 - 对不起，普雷斯特先生，我误会你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's hope it still works. - I'm sorry I misjudged you, Mr. Prescott.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.61,1:10:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Likewise.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.61,1:10:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还记得娜塔莉的表情…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll never forget Miss Natalie's reaction.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.07,1:10:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,当她一回到家 看到你对她房子的所作所为\N{\fnArial\fs30}when she came home and saw what you'd done to the house.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.04,1:10:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的爱看她气急败坏的样子！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do love watching her hyperventilate!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.08,1:10:58.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是这份工作中为数不多的乐趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's one of the few pleasures of this job.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.13,1:11:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你讨厌这工作 你为什么不辞职呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you hate this job, why don't you quit?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.42,1:11:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,工作可没那么好找\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jobs aren't that easy to come by.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.05,1:11:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算找的到，新的工作说不定还更糟糕呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, I could end up working for someone far worse.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.35,1:11:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不应该待在你讨厌的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shouldn't stay someplace you hate just 'cause you're scared.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.27,1:11:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕竟「人生苦短」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Life's too short.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.06,1:11:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.23,1:11:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And… voila.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.36,1:11:20.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你进不进的去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see if you fit.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.15,1:11:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯，抱起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.03,1:11:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch your head.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.32,1:11:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一上去，就先放你出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}As soon as I get up, I'm gonna let you out.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.70,1:11:29.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只要注意你自己就行，听到没？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just take care of yourself, you hear?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.34,1:11:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你说，我好像听到什么声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm tellin' ya, I heard something.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.55,1:11:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错，要保持警觉心，薇拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Stay very alert here, Vera.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.22,1:11:51.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然我都这么说了 不如你下去检查一下酒窖？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tell you what. Why don't you go down, check out the wine cellar?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.18,1:11:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 - 是，你去那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - Yeah. There you go.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.73,1:11:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在下面！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down here!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.65,1:12:03.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好待着…喔！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better stay… oww!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.36,1:12:06.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,薇拉！喔！啊！薇拉！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vera! Ow! Aah! Vera!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.91,1:12:09.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了？喔 - 按按钮！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? Ooh! - Hit the button!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.28,1:12:12.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 坚持一下，宝贝 - 喔！不，不，按那个按钮！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hang on, baby! - Oh! No, no! Hit the button!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.16,1:12:15.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？我听不到你 - 按按钮！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? I can't hear you. - Hit the button!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.33,1:12:17.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喔！ - 喔！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh! - Oww!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.92,1:12:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，不！不是那个 是另一个按钮！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no! Not that one! The other button!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.04,1:12:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这个！啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.59,1:12:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.68,1:12:29.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个小鬼！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.30,1:12:32.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这里！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over here!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.90,1:12:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨，妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.13,1:13:02.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.79,1:13:05.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见，开门！\N{\fnArial\fs30}See ya. Door, open!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.31,1:13:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜塔莉，你去接皇室成员 我回去找凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Natalie, you go get the royals. I'm gonna go back and check on Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.39,1:13:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？现在吗？ - 没错，我感觉到一定是出事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What, now? - Yeah, somethin's up. I can sense it.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.81,1:13:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你应该要体谅为人父母的心情 - 话不能这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maybe you have to be a parent. - That's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.48,1:13:27.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也知道我很关心小孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how much I care about kids.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.74,1:13:29.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你有关心我的小孩吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much do you care about my kid?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.37,1:13:34.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,出租车！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taxi!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.62,1:13:40.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文？你没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin? Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.10,1:14:06.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈，你能开慢一点吗？ 凯文应该没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom, do you think you could slow down a little bit? Kevin's probably fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.19,1:14:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只要注意看有没有警察？知道吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just keep an eye out for cops, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.90,1:14:11.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，薇拉，你去检查客厅\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Vera. Go check out the living room.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.49,1:14:13.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看他有没有躲在那里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}See if he's in there, all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.32,1:14:15.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊！我真敢不相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}God! I can't believe this.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.62,1:14:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该去上大学，\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shoulda gone to college.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.99,1:14:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要两年！ 我就能成为一名牙体技术师，两年！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two years, coulda been a dental technician. Two years!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.12,1:14:22.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,马文！他在卧室！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marv! He's in the bedroom!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.71,1:14:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妈妈？ - 去抓他！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mom? - Get him!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.30,1:14:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Door, open.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.10,1:14:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.45,1:14:54.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯，啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uuh! Gaah!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.41,1:14:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.79,1:15:00.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.12,1:15:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,关门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Door, close.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.04,1:15:10.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨，茉莉！ - 进去那里面！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, Molly! - Get in there!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.51,1:15:17.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,马文，亲爱的，你在里面吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marv, honey. You in there?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.39,1:15:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴，薇拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up, Vera!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.39,1:15:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，我只是想…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, okay. I was just tryin' to…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.60,1:15:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴，你这个白痴！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up, you moron.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.39,1:15:25.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，我不是白痴，你这个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I'm no moron, you jerk.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.81,1:15:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 闭嘴，你这蠢蛋！ - 开门！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shut up, ya bag! - Door, open!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.86,1:15:36.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在发什么神经？ - 你才发什么神经？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's wrong with you? - What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.03,1:15:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不是蠢蛋，而且你知道吗？ 你也不是天才！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm no bag. And you know what? You ain't no genius!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.53,1:15:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 薇拉，亲爱的… - 不，不要对我说「薇拉，亲爱的」！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Vera, honey… - No! Don't "Vera, honey" me!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.83,1:15:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 亲爱的… - 你根本没那个小鬼聪明，因为你完全…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not even as smart as this kid, who, in case you hadn't noticed,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.46,1:15:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,被那个小鬼打败了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}is totally kickin' our butts!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.17,1:15:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，从现在开始 我是我自己的老大！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, from now on, I am my own boss!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.17,1:15:52.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 薇拉，薇拉，亲爱的… - 不要叫我「亲爱的」！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Vera. Vera, honey… - Don't "honey" me!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.13,1:15:55.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝，宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pumpkin. Pumpkin.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.05,1:15:59.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,马文！别理她！去抓那个小鬼 我几分钟后就出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marv! Forget about her! Get the kid! I'll be outta here in a few minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.98,1:16:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.82,1:16:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.04,1:16:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！嘿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.13,1:16:35.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,芝麻开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open sesame.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.38,1:16:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 竟然有这玩意！ - 这太神奇了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, get a load of that. - Holy majolie!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.89,1:16:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧！薇拉！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Vera!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.60,1:16:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，快出来，小鬼！\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right! Come on out, kid!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.94,1:16:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah! All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.19,1:16:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开酒柜，打开书架\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open bar. Open bookshelf.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.36,1:16:55.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开…书架 打开书…酒柜…架\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open… open book-bar. Open book-bar-shelf.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.24,1:16:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 打开…开书…酒柜…鬼东西 - 芝麻开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Open… open book-bar-thing. - Open sesame.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.78,1:17:00.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是愚蠢 哇！\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's stupid. Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.87,1:17:01.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在谁是笨蛋？你这个笨蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's stupid now, stupid?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.03,1:17:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨，算了，离我远一点，行吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, come on. Just get off me, all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.87,1:17:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要提高注意力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna take care of everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.16,1:17:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,酒柜，芝麻回转\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bar, revolve sesame.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.12,1:17:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心！我们会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch this. It's all gonna be fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.71,1:17:13.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 酒柜，停止 - 喔！越转越快了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bar, stop. - Oh! It's goin' faster!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.17,1:17:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,是，我知道，薇拉 我知道越转越快了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know, Vera. I know it's goin' faster.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.80,1:17:20.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 芝麻加速 - 老婆你人不舒服…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Speed faster sesame. - Okay. The wife's not feelin'…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.68,1:17:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,芝麻加速！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Faster sesame!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.43,1:17:31.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,芝麻霹雳无敌快速\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maximum speed sesame.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.53,1:17:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,芝麻停止\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop sesame.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.01,1:18:00.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,摔得不错喔，马文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice jump, Marv.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.56,1:18:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ohh!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.86,1:18:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oof!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.00,1:18:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家圣诞快乐 这真是个美好的夜晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merry Christmas to all, and to all a good night.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.42,1:18:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安！ 啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.80,1:18:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.30,1:18:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 普雷斯特先生 - 随时为你效劳\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mr. Prescott! - At your service.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.76,1:18:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你！真高兴见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boy, am I glad to see you.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.72,1:18:51.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想我们应该报警 - 好主意，普雷斯特先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Perhaps we should call the police. - Good idea, Mr. Prescott.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.39,1:18:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫我普雷斯特就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just "Prescott" to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.52,1:18:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,普雷斯特！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prescott.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.24,1:19:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我记得你说过你不担心的 - 我有吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I thought you said you weren't worried. - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.91,1:19:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉出事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just had a feeling.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.08,1:19:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.00,1:19:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.59,1:19:22.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妈妈！ - 妈妈？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mom! - Mom?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.42,1:19:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们是谁？ - 啊哈！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who are they? - Uh-oh!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.93,1:19:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们得快点离开！ - 快追上去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's get outta here! - Around the back!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.35,1:19:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们也去追，快！ - 凯文！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're on it. Let's go! - Kevin!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.48,1:19:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔喔！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh-ooh!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.15,1:19:44.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.20,1:19:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 啊！ - 太好了！你们抓到了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah! Way to go, guys!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.37,1:19:49.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.00,1:19:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 凯文！ - 妈妈！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Kevin! - Mom!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.29,1:19:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喔，亲爱的，很高兴你平安没事 - 啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, honey! I'm so glad you're all right. - Ohh!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.58,1:20:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我在这里 - 对不起，我没有相信你的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I am now! - I'm so sorry I didn't believe you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.59,1:20:03.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯！嗯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm! Mmm!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.51,1:20:05.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察已经来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The police have been summoned.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.01,1:20:08.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我帮大家准备了许多有趣的行程\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got lots of fun planned for your stay.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.26,1:20:10.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以去瑞格利棒球场？还有水族馆？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we go to Wrigley Field? And the aquarium?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.97,1:20:12.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了，你有小孩吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any kids?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.52,1:20:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 但我保证我们的行程\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. But I promise we'll have.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.56,1:20:17.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,会非常刺激有趣！\N{\fnArial\fs30}a very exciting time.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.98,1:20:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,真酷！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cool!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.78,1:20:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔，其实待在监狱也不算太差\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on. No, prison's not so bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.91,1:20:29.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喔，是吗？ - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, yeah? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.87,1:20:32.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 每个星期四都有牛排吃 - 啊，我知道那间监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}- On Thursdays you get Salisbury steak. - Yeah, I know about prison.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.62,1:20:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那就是我遇见你的地方 - 冷静，冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's where I met you. - Calm down. Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.70,1:20:36.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要冷静下来 - 女士，嗯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You calm down. - Women, eh?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.25,1:20:38.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 嘿，别碰我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Hey, don't touch me.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.67,1:20:46.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 彼得！他干了什么好事？ - 非常棒，他拯救了一切，就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Peter! What's he done now? - Well, he saved the day, that's what.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.22,1:20:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该谢谢他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should be thanking him.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.93,1:20:52.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,茉莉 到底发生什么事了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Molly? What in the world is going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.51,1:20:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们想要绑架王子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems they were gonna kidnap the prince.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.27,1:20:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,还好我们先逮捕他们，她是主谋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Best we can gather, she's the boss.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.77,1:20:59.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是我的女佣，我是她的老板！\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's my maid. I'm her boss!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.98,1:21:02.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好，看来你得找个新女佣了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, looks like you're gonna have to find a new maid.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.40,1:21:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕还得找个新管家\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a new butler, I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.07,1:21:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要辞职 - 辞职？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I resign. - Resign?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.24,1:21:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,但…为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But… why?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.78,1:21:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为有个聪明的小鬼说过「人生苦短」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because as a wise young man once said, "Life's too short."
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.33,1:21:21.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得，来帮我说说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter, do something.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.59,1:21:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，我来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Here goes.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.22,1:21:28.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜塔莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Natalie…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.55,1:21:32.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我错了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I mistook.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.05,1:21:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为爱而胡乱寻找刺激\N{\fnArial\fs30}infatuation and excitement for love.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.27,1:21:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着，这… 这是你的世界，不是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, this-this… this is your world. It's not mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.44,1:21:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在要做的 就是陪伴我的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, the whole time I was here, all I did was miss my family.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.06,1:21:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们全家人沉浸在幸福之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in love with my wife and kids,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.03,1:21:46.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是属于他们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I belong with them.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.99,1:21:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I wanna come home.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.45,1:21:52.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你需要时间来理解这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I understand if you need time to think about it. I…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.16,1:21:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.91,1:22:01.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.96,1:22:03.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我爱你 - 我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I love you. - I love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.30,1:22:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,小朋友，我们该如何 向你表达我们的祝贺之意？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Young man, how are we ever going to show you our gratitude?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.67,1:22:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们全家一起来 跟我们过圣诞节，如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would your family like to spend Christmas with our family?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.76,1:22:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来真棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}That sounds cool.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.06,1:22:17.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没事了吧？ - 没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is that okay? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.02,1:22:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定要和他们在一起？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to be with them?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.06,1:22:20.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.48,1:22:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,在圣诞节？\N{\fnArial\fs30}On Christmas?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.07,1:22:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.16,1:22:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,放音乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Music, on.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.00,1:22:41.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,下雪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Snow, fall.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.83,1:22:45.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈！嘿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha ha! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.63,1:22:48.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道今天是最棒的圣诞节！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew this was gonna be the best Christmas ever!
